It looks like the call trace is:

 - do_unlinkat
   - vfs_unlink
     - vfat_unlink
       * lock_super
       - fat_remove_entries
         - fat_sync_inode
           - fat_write_inode
             * lock_super

So this code really really liked BKL because it was recursive.  I am
testing a naive patch to address this problem and will follow up on it
in a bit.

